 "￦1,100", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 1, "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 5, "sellerUrl": "http://www.loeschware.com", "artistId": 313094176, "artistName": "LoeschWare", "bundleId": "com.domain.flm", "price": 1100.0, "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true, "trackId": 313094173, "trackName": "Five Little Monkeys", "primaryGenreName": "Games", "primaryGenreId": 6014, "sellerName": "LoeschWare", "currentVersionReleaseDate": "2020-02-24T15:16:19Z", "genreIds": ["6014", "7009", "7011", "6017"], "releaseNotes": "Support for iPhone X, XR, 11 Pro, 11 Pro Max", "version": "2.3.5", "wrapperType": "software", "currency": "KRW", "description": "->  Highly recommended for Education by the App Store, as well as teachers and parents around the world! \n\n\"My Kids LOVE This App\"\n--by Father of 3 (Under 4 yrs.)\n\n\"Perfect. Great fun for a toddler. My best toddler buy yet.\"\n--by Ro-dub\n_____________________________________________\n\"Mama Called the Doctor and the Doctor Said, \"No More Monkeys Jumping on the Bed!\"\n\nDesigned by parents of young children for young children (pre-toddler and older), Five Little Monkeys is a fun, interactive musical counting game based on the popular rhyme everybody knows and loves.  \n\nCOUNTING: Children build counting and math skills as well as color recognition by adding and subtracting different colored monkeys from play, simply by touching a monkey, or shaking your iPhone. \n\nOPPOSITES: Interactive objects teach concepts like stop/go, on/off, open/close, utilizing  an alarm clock that rings, a lamp, a telephone, a door, even a monkey family portrait that reacts to your child's touch!  \n\nREADING: Following along with the highlighted words to the rhyme fosters word recognition and sentence building skills, an important step toward a lifetime of reading and learning.   \n\nSINGING:  3 original music types to play and sing to; Country, Rock, or Pop for sing-a-long.  \n\nExplore, touch, and control the game with interactive options that allow creative freedom for your preschooler.  This application might keep your little monkey from jumping on the bed!   \n\n - Designed for young children from 1 year and up ( pre-toddler to preschool )\n - New interactive features that your child will love, including toys that react to touch, a peekaboo dog, and a stop-n-go button that starts and stops the monkeys jumping to allow children to explore the monkeys' bedroom.\n - Touch or \"Shake\" the Monkeys to watch them do somersaults! \n - Press the highest number in the left corner to add the monkeys back to the bed.  Watch them drop back into action!\n - Interact with objects throughout the bedroom\n\n->Enjoy our other educational apps for children:  \n-  Old MacDonald \n-  My A B C Train\n-  Word Wheel\n-  Big Top Circus\n-  The Bear Went Over the Mountain\n\nCONTACT US: Email us at support@loeschware.com for any questions. We will promptly respond to you.\n\nThanks,\nLoeschWare LLC", "minimumOsVersion": "8.0", "releaseDate": "2011-11-02T00:43:42Z", "genres": ["게임", "가족", "음악", "교육"], "userRatingCount": 1}]}